  "description": "Log content (LogQL/Loki) for krg-prod. Grafana Alloy ships the systemd journal to Loki; the label set used here (job, unit) comes straight from Alloy's config (nix/docker-compose/krg-prod/loki/config.alloy): job=\"nixos_rebuild\" for the journal, with `unit` relabeled from the systemd unit. If a panel shows nothing, the label selector needs adjusting to the live stream labels (check Explore on the krg-loki-ds datasource).",
